(7446768, 1178123, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow I freaked slightly when I saw this! Montreal! When I was there last year I took a very similar photo even with the mist on the top and nearly entered it in  a challenge, this reminds me a lot of this photo.</td>', 'Wow I freaked slightly when I saw this! Montreal! When I was there last year I took a very similar photo even with the mist on the top and nearly entered it in  a challenge, this reminds me a lot of this photo.', '2016-03-30 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446770, 1178386, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there I  know how stunning this place is. I would go as far as saying it was probably the most gorgeous place we travelled to when were in Italy. it''s a shame you didn''t wait for a sunset or sunrise, the  lighting is very flat maybe you just was not out and about at the right time, but man this could''ve been really really good!</td>', 'I''ve been there I  know how stunning this place is. I would go as far as saying it was probably the most gorgeous place we travelled to when were in Italy. it''s a shame you didn''t wait for a sunset or sunrise, the  lighting is very flat maybe you just was not out and about at the right time, but man this could''ve been really really good!', '2016-03-30 22:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446795, 1178376, 140305, '<td valign="top">Love this! Her expression cracks me up :)</td>', 'Love this! Her expression cracks me up :)', '2016-03-31 01:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446946, 1178385, 30861, '<td valign="top">This OUGHT to be "just a postcard" but for some reason it''s a fascinating slice of life...I think it''s something about the gal with a surfboard and a billed cap leaving the water lower left that makes it all work. Mentally cross her out and it falls sorta flat. Cool shot!</td>', 'This OUGHT to be "just a postcard" but for some reason it''s a fascinating slice of life...I think it''s something about the gal with a surfboard and a billed cap leaving the water lower left that makes it all work. Mentally cross her out and it falls sorta flat. Cool shot!', '2016-03-31 22:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446947, 1178396, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish we had eyes :-( If we could see his eyes it would be worth an extra point to me. Still a 7, fascinating detail.</td>', 'I wish we had eyes :-( If we could see his eyes it would be worth an extra point to me. Still a 7, fascinating detail.', '2016-03-31 22:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
