(7448170, 1178173, 50695, '<td valign="top">tips on composition... the foreground and background are competing and interfering with each other. One pyramid is coming out of the camel''s hump. the same camel''s head disappears behind another camel and his neck leads right up into the other pyramid, which also cuts through the rider awkwardly. No vignette will fix that.</td>', 'tips on composition... the foreground and background are competing and interfering with each other. One pyramid is coming out of the camel''s hump. the same camel''s head disappears behind another camel and his neck leads right up into the other pyramid, which also cuts through the rider awkwardly. No vignette will fix that.', '2016-04-05 17:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
