(7448259, 1178278, 98565, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue!<br/>This is really lovely and when I saw it first I already knew it would be a winner<br/> <br/>I agree with Robert <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> about the halos and I think the buildings are somewhat mellow, but it doesn''t affect the beauty of the scene combined with the dramatic sky</td>', 'Congrats on the blue!This is really lovely and when I saw it first I already knew it would be a winner I agree with Robert  Bear_Music about the halos and I think the buildings are somewhat mellow, but it doesn''t affect the beauty of the scene combined with the dramatic sky', '2016-04-06 03:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
